# The kit `spell` (checked out at `~/www/spell`) is ONE repo since epic repo-split P20:  its own code (src/, tests/,
# bin/, scripts/), its folders (parser/, ui/, epic/, app/), the house style (agents/) and the glue (package.json,
# yarn.lock, .yarnrc.yml, repos.json5, tools/).
# - The child repos that were cloned inside it until then (spell-parser/, spell-ui/ ...) may still be on disk in an
#   older checkout:  ignored here.  The repos beside the kit (spell-brand) are outside it, at ../spell-brand.
/spell-*/
# the page server's projects beside the kit, each checkout's own (page/settings.ts LOCAL_SETTINGS)
/page-server.local.json5
# the content repo (epic repo-split J5):  its own git repo, local only;  your projects, spell.spaces, are beside the kit
/spell.epics

node_modules
.yarn/install-state.gz
.DS_Store
.vitest/
*.log
*.code-workspace
# `/park`'s note on where parked work stopped:  never committed
PARKED-*.md
# the page server's records, at its root:  the kit's since epic repo-split P16 (its pid file, the app's editor's);  its
# logs are `*.log`
.spell-server.json
.spell-server.*.json
# the MAIN checkout's marker:  worktree windows hide its folder's files (spell-epic's window script)
/.spell-main

# the declarations the kit builds for the repos above it (`spell-types`, epic repo-split I12):  never committed
dist-types/


# `spell publish`'s packed packages and their staging folders (epic repo-split P19):  never committed
/dist-packs/

# Claude Code's own worktrees (an agent's isolated copy):  never the kit's files
/.claude/worktrees/

# `spell map`'s maps (graphify's, and the merged code.json / docs.json, epic coherence P1):  rebuilt on demand, never committed
graphify-out/
